# mm.shell

The shell and environment concerns other modules would otherwise each reach past their own interface for: the interactive shell name, this process's environment variables, and a small parser for this project's own scripts.

buildable-target no because setenv and unsetenv are POSIX and newlib does not
provide them, so this module cannot compile for a freestanding target. Its only
consumers, tools/shell and tests/mm/shell, are host-only already.
